---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";

const title = "Territorial Aggression Management San Jacinto | Good Doggos";
const description = "Reclaim your property and your peace with territorial aggression management in San Jacinto. We dismantle entitlement to transform your home into a calm environment.";

const jsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Service",
  "name": "Territorial Aggression Management",
  "description": description,
  "provider": {
    "@type": "LocalBusiness",
    "name": "Good Doggos",
    "url": "https://gooddoggos.com",
    "telephone": "+19514016252",
    "address": {
      "@type": "PostalAddress",
      "addressLocality": "San Jacinto",
      "addressRegion": "CA",
      "addressCountry": "US"
    }
  },
  "areaServed": {
    "@type": "AdministrativeArea",
    "name": "Riverside County"
  },
  "url": "https://gooddoggos.com/services/territorial-aggression"
};
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(jsonLd)} />
  </Fragment>

  <!-- Hero Band -->
  <section class="bg-primary-navy pt-32 pb-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Breadcrumb -->
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-body text-white/50 mt-6 mb-4" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/" class="text-accent-gold hover:text-accent-gold/80 underline font-semibold">Home</a>
        <span>&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href="/services/aggression-rehabilitation" class="text-accent-gold hover:text-accent-gold/80 underline font-semibold">Aggression Rehabilitation</a>
        <span>&rsaquo;</span>
        <span class="text-white/80 truncate">Territorial Aggression</span>
      </nav>

      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-bold text-white leading-tight mb-6">
        Territorial Aggression Management in San Jacinto
      </h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Body Content -->
  <section class="py-16 px-4 bg-[#FCF9FA]">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-12">
      
      <!-- Main Content -->
      <div class="prose max-w-none">
        <p class="text-secondary-slate leading-[1.8] font-body text-[16px] mb-6">
          If your front window is a war zone and you’re tired of apologizing to the Amazon driver, you’re dealing with territorial aggression. That explosive reaction when someone breathes near your property line in San Jacinto is a symptom of a dog that feels they must manage the perimeter.
        </p>
        <p class="text-secondary-slate leading-[1.8] font-body text-[16px] mb-6">
          Because we are professionals, we do not guess or hand out generic advice. We must evaluate your dog in person to see the interaction at your door or fence line before we can dismantle that entitlement. Closing the blinds is just a Band-Aid for a problem that requires real leadership.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-primary-navy mt-12 mb-6">
          Reclaiming Your Property and Your Peace
        </h2>
        <p class="text-secondary-slate leading-[1.8] font-body text-[16px] mb-6">
          At Good Doggos, I don't buy the "he's just protecting the house" excuse. For 8 years, I’ve specialized in dismantling the entitlement that drives territorial outbursts. My balanced approach is built on the reality that *you* own the house, not the dog. I use rewards to reinforce neutral behavior when the doorbell rings, but I also believe in clear, physical boundaries.
        </p>
        <p class="text-secondary-slate leading-[1.8] font-body text-[16px] mb-6">
          I often use my "Parenting Analogy" for this. We wouldn't let a child scream at people from the front window, and we shouldn't allow it from our dogs. I remember a case where we reclaimed the front door of a San Jacinto home. By using calibrated leash corrections to interrupt the "loading" phase—the stiffening and staring *before* the first bark—we showed the dog that acting like a maniac wasn't an option. Once they realized they wasn't in charge of "security," they finally relaxed.
        </p>
        <p class="text-secondary-slate leading-[1.8] font-body text-[16px] mb-6">
          We bring the training directly to your "hot zones"—the door, the side fence, the driveway near the Ramona Expressway. I’ll show you how to use spatial pressure to back your dog off the door, turning a high-stress confrontation into a neutral interaction.
        </p>
        <p class="text-secondary-slate leading-[1.8] font-body text-[16px] mb-6 font-bold">
          Stop letting your dog dictate who is allowed on your property. Apply for a Free Behavioral Assessment.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
     CTA BAND
══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[#FBF1E9]" style="border-top: 1px solid #E6DAC6;">
  <div class="w-full h-[3px]" style="background: linear-gradient(to right, #0F6D72, #D1B27F, #0F6D72);"></div>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-20 md:py-24 text-center">
    <p class="text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mb-4" style="color: rgba(15,109,114,0.60);">Your Dog Is Next</p>
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold mb-4" style="color: #0B2744;">
      Ready to See What's Possible?<br/>
      <span class="headline-accent" style="color: #D1B27F; font-style: italic; font-weight: 700;">Start With a Free Assessment.</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="text-base mb-10 max-w-lg mx-auto" style="color: rgba(17,32,50,0.60);">
      Tell us about your dog. We'll do an honest assessment and point you toward the right program — or tell you if we're not the right fit.
    </p>
    <a href="/apply"
       class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-bold text-sm tracking-widest uppercase rounded-full transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
       style="background: #D1B27F; color: #0B2744; padding: 18px 44px; box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(209,178,127,0.35);">
      Apply for Free Behavioral Assessment →
    </a>
    <p class="mt-4 text-xs" style="color: rgba(17,32,50,0.40);">Takes less than 3 minutes · No commitment required</p>
  </div>
</div>
</Layout>
